---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="The Build — Sustainabox Container Home Construction" description="Follow the Sustainabox build: a container home in the Texas Hill Country designed with resilience principles and 7 years of homebuilding expertise.">

	<!-- Hero -->
	<header class="page-hero" style="background-image: url('/images/crane-over-lake.webp');">
		<div class="page-hero-inner">
			<span class="eyebrow">Building the Box</span>
			<h1>The Build, Documented</h1>
			<p>From raw land to finished home — the drawings, systems, and decisions behind Sustainabox.</p>
		</div>
	</header>

	<!-- Building the Box Slider -->
	<section class="slider-section">
		<div class="container">
			<h2>Building the Box</h2>
			<p>Swipe through each phase of the build journey.</p>

			<div class="carousel-wrapper">
				<div class="carousel">
					<!-- Slide 1: The Build -->
					<div class="carousel-slide">
						<div class="slide-header">
							<h3>The Build</h3>
							<p>From design to delivery to foundation. Here's how it started.</p>
						</div>
						<div class="slide-gallery">
							<img src="/images/elevation-1.webp" alt="Final design elevation" loading="lazy" />
							<img src="/images/crane-over-lake.webp" alt="Crane delivery over water" loading="lazy" />
							<img src="/images/crane.webp" alt="Crane placement on site" loading="lazy" />
							<img src="/images/foundation.webp" alt="Pier foundation detail" loading="lazy" />
						</div>
					</div>

					<!-- Slide 2: Structural & Systems -->
					<div class="carousel-slide">
						<div class="slide-header">
							<h3>Structural & Systems</h3>
							<p>Framing, welding, insulation, and MEP rough-in. Building it solid.</p>
						</div>
						<div class="slide-gallery">
							<img src="/images/windows-and-doors-welding.webp" alt="Welding windows and doors" loading="lazy" />
							<img src="/images/steel-reinforcements.webp" alt="Steel reinforcements" loading="lazy" />
							<img src="/images/spray-foam.webp" alt="Spray foam insulation" loading="lazy" />
						</div>
					</div>

					<!-- Slide 3: 20 ft -->
					<div class="carousel-slide">
						<div class="slide-header">
							<h3>20 ft</h3>
							<p>The 20-foot container — window cut, interior framing, and wood finishes.</p>
						</div>
						<div class="slide-gallery">
							<img src="/images/20-ft-window-cut.webp" alt="20ft container window cut" loading="lazy" />
							<img src="/images/20ft-interior-wood.webp" alt="20ft interior wood detail" loading="lazy" />
							<img src="/images/20ft-interior-wood2.webp" alt="20ft interior wood finish" loading="lazy" />
						</div>
					</div>

					<!-- Slide 4: Interiors & Finishes -->
					<div class="carousel-slide">
						<div class="slide-header">
							<h3>Interiors & Finishes</h3>
							<p>Kitchen, bath, flooring, and details. The space where living happens.</p>
						</div>
						<div class="slide-gallery">
							<img src="/images/flooring.webp" alt="Flooring installation" loading="lazy" />
							<img src="/images/kitchen-cabinets.webp" alt="Kitchen cabinets" loading="lazy" />
							<img src="/images/kitchen-bathroom.webp" alt="Kitchen and bathroom layout" loading="lazy" />
							<img src="/images/shower.webp" alt="Shower installation" loading="lazy" />
						</div>
					</div>

					<!-- Slide 4: Exteriors & Outdoor -->
					<div class="carousel-slide">
						<div class="slide-header">
							<h3>Exteriors & Outdoor</h3>
							<p>Deck, landscape, and outdoor living spaces.</p>
						</div>
						<div class="slide-gallery">
							<img src="/images/deck.webp" alt="Deck construction" loading="lazy" />
							<img src="/images/deck-2.webp" alt="Deck detail" loading="lazy" />
							<img src="/images/car-port.webp" alt="Carport detail" loading="lazy" />
						</div>
					</div>
				</div>

				<!-- Navigation -->
				<button class="carousel-btn carousel-prev" aria-label="Previous slide">❮</button>
				<button class="carousel-btn carousel-next" aria-label="Next slide">❯</button>

				<!-- Indicators -->
				<div class="carousel-indicators">
					<button class="indicator active" data-slide="0" aria-label="Go to slide 1"></button>
					<button class="indicator" data-slide="1" aria-label="Go to slide 2"></button>
					<button class="indicator" data-slide="2" aria-label="Go to slide 3"></button>
					<button class="indicator" data-slide="3" aria-label="Go to slide 4"></button>
					<button class="indicator" data-slide="4" aria-label="Go to slide 5"></button>
				</div>
			</div>
		</div>
	</section>

	<!-- Specifications -->
	<section id="specs">
		<div class="container">
			<h2>The Build</h2>
			<p>Sustainabox is a custom container home built from one 20-foot and two 40-foot high-cube (HC) one-trip shipping containers. Set on pier foundations and connected by a deck to create a courtyard, the layout balances comfort, function, and adaptability.</p>
			<p>We're using a combination of detailed SketchUp models, hand-drawn diagrams, and site surveys to guide the build and coordinate with trades.</p>

			<div class="container-grid">
				<div class="container-card">
					<div class="container-label">C1</div>
					<h3>Container 1</h3>
					<p class="container-size">40-foot HC one-trip</p>
					<p>Main living space with kitchen, living room, and 1/2 bathroom. Sits at the rear of the build site, parallel to the road.</p>
				</div>
				<div class="container-card">
					<div class="container-label">C2</div>
					<h3>Container 2</h3>
					<p class="container-size">40-foot HC one-trip</p>
					<p>Positioned to the right side and connected with C1 at the rear left corner. Houses two bedrooms, a full bathroom, and a utility space with washer/dryer.</p>
				</div>
				<div class="container-card">
					<div class="container-label">C3</div>
					<h3>Container 3</h3>
					<p class="container-size">20-foot HC one-trip</p>
					<p>Parallel to C2 on the left side. A flex space — office, guest room, and storage. Power and AC, no plumbing. Sits separately from the main layout.</p>
				</div>
			</div>
		</div>
	</section>

	<!-- Drawings -->
	<section id="drawings" class="section-alt">
		<div class="container">
			<h2>Drawings</h2>
			<p>These drawings include a mix of exports from our SketchUp 3D model and hand-drawn details. We update this section as the design evolves and as trades provide input.</p>

			<h3>Survey</h3>
			<p>The survey was provided during the property purchase and shows the full lot, including the small piece of land that was added years ago and officially merged into the parcel. It captures early topographic details and key landmarks, such as the original wood shed, which has since been removed. The entire foundation and container placement were aligned around this feature.</p>
			<div class="gallery">
				<img src="/images/survey-1.webp" alt="Full property survey" loading="lazy" />
				<img src="/images/survey-2.webp" alt="Survey detail - lot boundaries" loading="lazy" />
				<img src="/images/survey-3.webp" alt="Survey detail - topographic features" loading="lazy" />
				<img src="/images/survey-4.webp" alt="Survey detail - landmarks" loading="lazy" />
				<img src="/images/survey-5.webp" alt="Survey detail - elevation notes" loading="lazy" />
			</div>

			<h3>Elevation</h3>
			<p>The elevation views were generated using geospatial mapping tools within SketchUp, pulling real-world terrain data and surrounding structures into the model. This tool has been incredibly useful for visualizing how the containers sit on the land.</p>
			<div class="gallery">
				<img src="/images/elevation-2-2.webp" alt="Elevation view - aerial perspective" loading="lazy" />
				<img src="/images/elevation-3.webp" alt="Elevation view - rear" loading="lazy" />
				<img src="/images/elevation-4.webp" alt="Elevation view - landscape context" loading="lazy" />
				<img src="/images/elevation-5.webp" alt="Elevation view - with terrain" loading="lazy" />
			</div>
		</div>
	</section>

	<!-- Foundation -->
	<section id="foundation">
		<div class="container">
			<h2>Foundation</h2>
			<p>The Sustainabox foundation is built using reinforced concrete piers designed to support the weight and structural demands of C1 and C2. C3 will have a temporary foundation.</p>

			<div class="gallery">
				<img src="/images/foundation-5.webp" alt="Foundation pier layout" loading="lazy" />
				<img src="/images/split-view-1.webp" alt="Split view - foundation and structure" loading="lazy" />
				<img src="/images/pier-detail.webp" alt="Widened pier detail at C1/C2 junction" loading="lazy" />
			</div>
		</div>
	</section>

	<!-- Interior -->
	<section id="interior" class="section-alt">
		<div class="container">
			<h2>Interior</h2>
			<p>C1 and C2 will be framed with metal studs, insulated using closed-cell spray foam, and finished with drywall. Container 3 will take a simpler approach with plywood walls and no plumbing.</p>

			<div class="gallery">
				<img src="/images/interior-1-1.webp" alt="Full compound overhead view" loading="lazy" />
				<img src="/images/interior-2.webp" alt="C2 - bedrooms, bathroom, utility" loading="lazy" />
				<img src="/images/interior-3.webp" alt="C1 - kitchen and living area" loading="lazy" />
				<img src="/images/interior-4.webp" alt="Interior layout flow" loading="lazy" />
				<img src="/images/interior-kitchen-container-3.webp" alt="Kitchen detail" loading="lazy" />
				<img src="/images/interior-20ft-2.webp" alt="C3 - flex space interior" loading="lazy" />
			</div>
		</div>
	</section>

	<!-- Systems -->
	<section id="systems">
		<div class="container">
			<h2>Systems</h2>

			<h3>Electrical</h3>
			<p>The electrical plans outline key circuits for each container, including dedicated runs for major appliances, lighting, switches, outlets, and utility connections. C3 will have a simplified 120V layout pending final AC requirements.</p>
			<div class="gallery">
				<img src="/images/electrical-plan-main-living-contatiner.webp" alt="Electrical plan - C1 main living" loading="lazy" />
				<img src="/images/electrical-plan-bedroom-utility-container.webp" alt="Electrical plan - C2 bedrooms/utility" loading="lazy" />
			</div>

			<h3>Plumbing</h3>
			<p>The plumbing layout covers fixture locations, supply and drain lines, and utility connections. C1 includes the kitchen, half bathroom, and tie-ins for hot water and filtration. C2 includes the main bathroom and laundry/utility connections.</p>
			<div class="gallery">
				<img src="/images/plumbing.webp" alt="Plumbing layout plan" loading="lazy" />
			</div>
		</div>
	</section>

	<!-- Contact -->
	<section id="contact">
		<div class="container contact-section">
			<h2>Get in Touch</h2>
			<p>Questions about the build? Want to connect?</p>
			<div class="contact-emails">
				<a href="mailto:jenswid@outlook.com" class="btn btn-outline">jenswid@outlook.com</a>
				<a href="mailto:codyswid@outlook.com" class="btn btn-outline">codyswid@outlook.com</a>
			</div>
		</div>
	</section>

	<!-- Property Gallery -->
	<section class="gallery-showcase">
		<div class="container">
			<h2>The Completed Project</h2>
			<p>Aerial, perspective, and interior views of the finished compound.</p>

			<div class="gallery-grid">
				<img src="/images/dji-fly-20251009-113558-0029-1760027921717-photo.webp" alt="Aerial view - compound overview" loading="lazy" />
				<img src="/images/dji-fly-20251009-113602-0030-1760027921121-photo.webp" alt="Aerial view - containers and landscape" loading="lazy" />
				<img src="/images/dji-fly-20251009-113608-0031-1760027920526-photo.webp" alt="Aerial view - deck and courtyard" loading="lazy" />
				<img src="/images/split-view-1.webp" alt="Split view - exterior perspective" loading="lazy" />
				<img src="/images/split-view-2.webp" alt="Split view - site context" loading="lazy" />
				<img src="/images/split-view-3.webp" alt="Split view - angle view" loading="lazy" />
			</div>
		</div>
	</section>

	<!-- What's Next -->
	<section class="whats-next">
		<div class="container">
			<h2>What's Next</h2>
			<p>Beyond the build, we're exploring how to share this experience and knowledge with others building alternative housing.</p>
			<a href="/vision" class="btn btn-primary">See Our Vision</a>
		</div>
	</section>

	<!-- Lightbox -->
	<div class="lightbox" id="lightbox">
		<img src="" alt="" />
	</div>

	<script>
		document.addEventListener('DOMContentLoaded', () => {
			// Carousel
			const carousel = document.querySelector('.carousel');
			const slides = document.querySelectorAll('.carousel-slide');
			const indicators = document.querySelectorAll('.indicator');
			const prevBtn = document.querySelector('.carousel-prev');
			const nextBtn = document.querySelector('.carousel-next');

			let currentSlide = 0;

			const wrapper = document.querySelector('.carousel-wrapper');

			function updateHeight(n) {
				if (wrapper) wrapper.style.height = (slides[n].scrollHeight + 80) + 'px';
			}

			function showSlide(n) {
				carousel.style.transform = `translateX(-${n * 100}%)`;
				indicators.forEach(indicator => indicator.classList.remove('active'));
				indicators[n].classList.add('active');
				currentSlide = n;
				updateHeight(n);
			}

			updateHeight(0);

			function nextSlide() {
				const next = (currentSlide + 1) % slides.length;
				showSlide(next);
			}

			function prevSlide() {
				const prev = (currentSlide - 1 + slides.length) % slides.length;
				showSlide(prev);
			}

			if (prevBtn && nextBtn && carousel) {
				prevBtn.addEventListener('click', prevSlide);
				nextBtn.addEventListener('click', nextSlide);

				indicators.forEach((indicator, index) => {
					indicator.addEventListener('click', () => showSlide(index));
				});
			}
		});

		const lightbox = document.getElementById('lightbox');
		const lbImg = lightbox?.querySelector('img');

		document.querySelectorAll('.gallery img, .gallery-grid img').forEach(img => {
			img.addEventListener('click', () => {
				if (lbImg && lightbox) {
					lbImg.src = img.src;
					lbImg.alt = img.alt;
					lightbox.classList.add('active');
				}
			});
		});

		lightbox?.addEventListener('click', () => {
			lightbox.classList.remove('active');
		});

		document.addEventListener('keydown', (e) => {
			if (e.key === 'Escape') lightbox?.classList.remove('active');
		});
	</script>

</Layout>

<style>
	/* Container cards */
	.container-grid {
		display: grid;
		grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(300px, 1fr));
		gap: 1.5rem;
		margin-top: 2.5rem;
	}

	.container-card {
		background: var(--color-warm);
		border-radius: 12px;
		padding: 2rem;
		border-left: 4px solid var(--color-blue);
	}

	.container-label {
		font-family: var(--font-heading);
		font-size: 0.85rem;
		font-weight: 700;
		color: var(--color-blue);
		text-transform: uppercase;
		letter-spacing: 0.1em;
		margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
	}

	.container-size {
		font-size: 0.9rem;
		color: var(--color-muted);
		font-weight: 500;
		margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
	}

	/* What's Next Section */
	.whats-next {
		padding: 5rem 0;
		background: var(--color-blue);
		color: white;
		text-align: center;
	}

	.whats-next h2 {
		color: white;
		margin-bottom: 1rem;
	}

	.whats-next p {
		font-size: 1.1rem;
		margin-bottom: 2rem;
		opacity: 0.95;
	}

	.whats-next .btn-primary {
		background: white;
		color: var(--color-blue);
	}

	.whats-next .btn-primary:hover {
		background: var(--color-sky);
	}

	/* Gallery Showcase */
	.gallery-showcase {
		padding: 5rem 0;
		background: white;
	}

	.gallery-showcase h2 {
		text-align: center;
		margin-bottom: 1rem;
	}

	.gallery-showcase > .container > p {
		text-align: center;
		color: var(--color-muted);
		margin-bottom: 2.5rem;
	}

	.gallery-grid {
		display: grid;
		grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(300px, 1fr));
		gap: 1rem;
		margin-bottom: 2rem;
	}

	.gallery-grid img {
		width: 100%;
		height: 250px;
		object-fit: cover;
		border-radius: 8px;
		cursor: pointer;
		transition: transform 0.3s ease, box-shadow 0.3s ease;
		box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.1);
	}

	.gallery-grid img:hover {
		transform: scale(1.02);
		box-shadow: 0 4px 16px rgba(0,0,0,0.15);
	}

	/* Contact */
	.contact-section {
		text-align: center;
		max-width: 600px;
	}

	.contact-emails {
		display: flex;
		flex-wrap: wrap;
		gap: 1rem;
		justify-content: center;
		margin-top: 1.5rem;
	}

	/* Lightbox */
	.lightbox {
		display: none;
		position: fixed;
		top: 0;
		left: 0;
		width: 100%;
		height: 100%;
		background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);
		z-index: 1000;
		padding: 2rem;
		overflow: auto;
	}

	.lightbox.active {
		display: flex;
		align-items: center;
		justify-content: center;
	}

	.lightbox img {
		max-width: 90vw;
		max-height: 90vh;
		object-fit: contain;
	}

	/* Carousel */
	.slider-section {
		padding: 5rem 0;
		background: white;
	}

	.slider-section h2 {
		text-align: center;
		margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
	}

	.slider-section > .container > p {
		text-align: center;
		color: var(--color-muted);
		margin-bottom: 2rem;
	}

	.carousel-wrapper {
		position: relative;
		background: var(--color-warm);
		border-radius: 4px;
		padding: 2rem;
		overflow: hidden;
		transition: height 0.4s ease;
	}

	.carousel {
		display: flex;
		transition: transform 0.5s ease-in-out;
	}

	.carousel-slide {
		min-width: 100%;
		padding: 2rem;
	}

	.slide-header {
		margin-bottom: 2rem;
		text-align: center;
	}

	.slide-header h3 {
		color: var(--color-navy);
		margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
	}

	.slide-header p {
		color: var(--color-muted);
		font-size: 0.95rem;
	}

	.slide-gallery {
		display: grid;
		grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fill, minmax(220px, 1fr));
		gap: 1rem;
		margin-bottom: 1rem;
	}

	.slide-gallery img {
		width: 100%;
		aspect-ratio: 4 / 3;
		object-fit: cover;
		border-radius: 4px;
		cursor: pointer;
		transition: transform 0.2s;
	}

	.slide-gallery img:hover {
		transform: scale(1.02);
	}

	.carousel-btn {
		position: absolute;
		top: 50%;
		transform: translateY(-50%);
		background: rgba(26, 39, 68, 0.7);
		color: white;
		border: none;
		font-size: 1.5rem;
		padding: 0.75rem 1rem;
		cursor: pointer;
		z-index: 10;
		transition: background 0.2s;
		border-radius: 4px;
	}

	.carousel-btn:hover {
		background: rgba(26, 39, 68, 0.95);
	}

	.carousel-prev {
		left: 1rem;
	}

	.carousel-next {
		right: 1rem;
	}

	.carousel-indicators {
		display: flex;
		justify-content: center;
		gap: 0.75rem;
		margin-top: 2rem;
	}

	.indicator {
		width: 10px;
		height: 10px;
		border-radius: 50%;
		background: var(--color-blue);
		border: none;
		cursor: pointer;
		opacity: 0.5;
		transition: opacity 0.2s;
	}

	.indicator.active {
		opacity: 1;
	}

	.indicator:hover {
		opacity: 0.8;
	}

	/* Mobile */
	@media (max-width: 768px) {
		.container-grid {
			grid-template-columns: 1fr;
		}

		.gallery-grid {
			grid-template-columns: 1fr;
		}

		.carousel-btn {
			font-size: 1rem;
			padding: 0.5rem 0.75rem;
		}

		.slide-gallery {
			grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
		}
	}
</style>
